    <summaries>
      <summary>
        <versionCode>00</versionCode>
        <actionDate>2025-09-26</actionDate>
        <actionDesc>Introduced in House</actionDesc>
        <updateDate>2026-08-27T19:34:37Z</updateDate>
        <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Literacy in Future Technologies Artificial Intelligence Act or the LIFT AI Act</strong></p><p>This bill authorizes the National Science Foundation&nbsp;to make merit-based grants to institutions of higher education, nonprofit organizations, and consortia of such entities to support artificial intelligence (AI) literacy for K-12 students and educators. Grants may be used for research and development of educational curricula, instructional material, professional development for teachers, and evaluation methods for AI literacy at the K-12 level.</p>]]></text>
      </summary>
    </summaries>
